{
  "bookId": "hero-212108",
  "id": "bond-28566",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28566001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "那边的大个子，过来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28566003",
              "text": "找我什么事？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28566003",
              "text": "不好的预感。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28566002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28566003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "你告诉我，究竟应该怎么做一个人？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28566004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "呃，这是能说的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28566005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "怎么，这做人的秘籍在你们M城是稀世孤本不成？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28566006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不，是世界上根本没有一本教程会告诉你怎么做人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28566007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "怎么会这样，唉，那我不是完了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28566008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "姐姐要我学会怎么做人，不然就不理我了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28566009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你是不是闯了什么祸惹她生气了?",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28566010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "没什么呀，不过是当着她的面囫囵生吞了一只蛙崽。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28566011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "很小很小的一只，都不够我塞牙缝儿的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28566012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "你知道手办不能吃东西，我看姐姐脸色不对，当时就吐出来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28566013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……我明白你姐姐为什么会生气了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28566014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "这么说你知道怎么教我做人咯？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28566015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "食色性也，我决定先教你学会鉴赏美食。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
